{%- comment -%}
  SYPerformance collection hub — child collections as cards.

  The other half of the Phase 8b catalogue restructure. Twelve sub-collections
  were created and wired into the nav, but the parents kept rendering every
  product in one grid: `syp-billet` was 110 products on one page and `honda`
  104, which is the thing that reads as a dump rather than a catalogue.

  Two design decisions worth stating, because both were the alternative:

  1. This is a RULE, not a template assignment. It lives in the default
     collection template and renders NOTHING when a collection has no children,
     so every collection gets hub behaviour the moment it earns it. Assigning a
     `collection.hub` template to two handles would have fixed two pages and
     needed a data change every time a sub-collection is added — and there are
     eleven parents in the menu today, not two: syp-billet, syp-drivetrain,
     honda, honda-k-series, honda-b-d-h-series, mitsubishi-evo-parts,
     mitsubishi-evo-7-8-9, forced-induction, universal-fabrication, engine and
     suspension.

  2. The hierarchy is READ FROM THE NAVIGATION MENU rather than from a
     metafield or a handle convention. The menu is where the parent/child
     relationship is already maintained by hand, it is what the hover menu
     renders, and it is what the store owner edits in the admin. A second copy
     of the same tree is a second thing to keep in sync, and it would drift.

  The product grid still renders below. It is what filtering, sorting and
  pagination act on, and a hub is also a legitimate "show me everything" page —
  the fix is that the cards come first, so the first screen is six routes rather
  than a hundred thumbnails.

  Self-reference is skipped: the nav has "Chassis & Suspension" pointing at
  /collections/suspension with a child that is also /collections/suspension, and
  a card linking to the page you are on is noise.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign nav = linklists[section.settings.menu]
  assign here = collection.url
-%}

{%- capture child_cards -%}
  {%- for l1 in nav.links -%}
    {%- if l1.url == here -%}
      {%- for child in l1.links -%}
        {% render 'syp-collection-card', link: child, here: here %}
      {%- endfor -%}
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- for l2 in l1.links -%}
      {%- if l2.url == here -%}
        {%- for child in l2.links -%}
          {% render 'syp-collection-card', link: child, here: here %}
        {%- endfor -%}
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- for l3 in l2.links -%}
        {%- if l3.url == here -%}
          {%- for child in l3.links -%}
            {% render 'syp-collection-card', link: child, here: here %}
          {%- endfor -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- if child_cards != blank -%}
  <div class="syp-hub">
    <div class="syp-hub__inner">
      <h2 class="syp-hub__heading">{{ section.settings.heading | default: 'Browse by category' }}</h2>

      <div class="syp-hub__grid">
        {{ child_cards }}
      </div>

      {%- if section.settings.show_all_line and collection.all_products_count > 0 -%}
        <p class="syp-hub__all syp-spec">
          {{ section.settings.all_label | default: 'Or scroll on for all' }}
          {{ collection.all_products_count }}
          {% if collection.all_products_count == 1 %}part{% else %}parts{% endif %}
        </p>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "SYP collection hub",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "syp-hub-section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "link_list",
      "id": "menu",
      "label": "Menu",
      "default": "main-menu",
      "info": "The hierarchy is read from this menu. A collection that appears in it with children below renders those children as cards; every other collection renders nothing here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Browse by category"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_all_line",
      "label": "Show the line pointing at the full grid",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "all_label",
      "label": "Full-grid line",
      "default": "Or scroll on for all"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "SYP collection hub" }]
}
{% endschema %}
